msgid ""
"The Arch User Repository contains build scripts that are known as PKGBUILDs. "
"Those scripts are uploaded by users, and are not verified or vetted in any "
"way. Only enable this feature if you are comfortable in verifying the build "
"scripts."
msgstr ""
"L'Arch User Repository conté scripts de construcció coneguts com a PKGBUILDs. "
"Aquests scripts són pujats pels usuaris i no es verifiquen ni se sotmeten a cap mena de revisió. "
"Activeu aquesta funcionalitat només si us sentiu còmodes verificant els scripts de construcció."

msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://www.seafoam-labs.org/shelly-alpm/docs/aur-safety/\">AUR "
"Safety Guide</a>"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://www.seafoam-labs.org/shelly-alpm/docs/aur-safety/\">Guia de seguretat "
"de l'AUR</a>"

